{"version":1,"content":"<p>提到汽車車身，大家腦海裏大多是鋼材、鋁合金或是碳纖維。而日產卻跳出傳統思路，把菠蘿葉子變成了製造車身面板的原材料，給汽車環保材料打開了全新方向。<strong>這項創新材料技術，是日產和環保企業Food Reborn攜手研發而成。菠蘿收穫之後，大量葉片都會被當作農業廢棄物直接處理，幾乎沒有利用價值。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587834.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T10:23:59.622291+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:07:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:14.419575+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:14.419575+00:00","content_hash":"244947d041c9ff91d62b848823af333c250a68d2c79b55e095778aafc261b96c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}